# Pairs with CausalOrder. b names a dependency it does not hold. The dependency semantics (#4586) are
# that a dependency names one write the author held; a named write that does not exist is below S
# vacuously and is released.
MODULE: CausalOrderDependencyNamesAnUnheldWrite
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a dependent names a write its author never held, which no watermark or identity can vouch for
PERTURBS: AuthorB
BOUNDS: Parts = {1}

--- FIND
    /\ Len(bdeps) < BWrites /\ t \in aCom
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: any HLC.
    /\ Len(bdeps) < BWrites /\ t \in Hlcs
--- END
